<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/definitionSource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "It is the authoritative or credible entity, document, or body of knowledge that provides the meaning of a type, ensuring accuracy, context, and standardization."@en .
