<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/zAxisLength> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "This property specifies the length along the z-axis of a hardware component. The value must be expressed using the /Core/UnitOfMeasure type which requires both a quantity, and a unitQUDT which must be a unit of length from the QUDT vocabulary, specifically constrained to the http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Length.\n\nZ axis is the height of the object."@en .
