<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/UnitOfMeasure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "UnitOfMeasure class provides a structured way to express measurements: such as size, weight, volume, or other quantities.\nIt combines a numerical value quantity with a unit reference unitQUDT that points to a URI in the QUDT (Quantity, Unit, Dimension and Type) ontology.\nThe QUDT ontology and specifications are available at www.qudt.org <https://www.qudt.org/>."@en .
